    "title": "Avelo Airlines extends its Connecticut flight schedule through at least mid-February - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Connecticut\nAvelo Airlines extends its Connecticut flight schedule through at least mid-February\n2 hours ago\nCONNECTICUT, USA — Avelo Airlines announced Wednesday that it has extended its Connecticut flight schedule through mid-February 2026. The timing of the announcement in July is meant to allow customers to begin planning their holiday trips. Those travelers can now book flights to 30 destinations through Feb. 10, 2026.\n1",
